%% alt: Two designs side by side: a single agent with one context and all the tools, and an orchestrator whose lead agent delegates to three sub-agents that return short summaries. Move from the first to the second only when testing shows a limit you can't fix.
flowchart LR
  subgraph S[Single agent]
    direction TB
    A1[One agent<br/>one context<br/>all tools]:::model
  end
  subgraph M[Multi-agent: orchestrator]
    direction TB
    L[Lead agent]:::model --> W1[Sub-agent]:::model
    L --> W2[Sub-agent]:::model
    L --> W3[Sub-agent]:::model
    W1 & W2 & W3 -->|summaries| L
  end
  S -.->|split only when tests show<br/>a limit you can't fix| M
